==Russian==

===Alternative spellings===
* [[lytdybr]]

===Etymology===
Recyrillization of 'lytdybr', from '''[[дневник]]''' ''(dnevnik,'' [[journal]], [[diary]]), as typed on a QWERTY keyboard instead of a Cyrillic one.

===Noun===
'''лытдыбр''' {{m}}

# [[blog]] posting about one’s daily life

